      "reviewBody": "The study combines ODE grant‑application and reporting data with USDA’s national Farm‑to‑School Census figures to describe the reach of Oregon’s farm‑to‑school education grants (e.g., number of districts, schools, students) in relation to nationwide farm‑to‑school participation trends.",
