    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewAspect": "join",
      "reviewBody": "When describing how local procurement activities were implemented, the study links findings from the Local Food Marketing Practices Survey (e.g., producer‑to‑school marketing channels) with USDA’s census data on the number of schools purchasing local produce.",
